The Sichuan broth hides around twenty spices.

6
00:00:11,200 --> 00:00:13,600
One pepper in it makes your lips go numb.

7
00:00:13,600 --> 00:00:16,000
Chongqing dock workers made this famous.

8
00:00:16,000 --> 00:00:18,400
Double-tap if you'd brave the red broth.

9
00:00:18,400 --> 00:00:21,400
★ Expert Tip: Order a split pot — mild on one side.

10
00:00:21,400 --> 00:00:24,000
Spicy or mild — which side is your seat?
